WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
|||||\\\\\\\\\\\\\

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Alchemy

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Shower

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:45.280
What if I don't mind dying?

00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:48.410
Can I then continue to love you?

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:53.000
In other words, I'm willing to risk it all

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:55.750
so that we can be together

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:59.210
I'll do so

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:03.760
Do the same, stick to your confession

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:07.300
Love me to death

00:01:21.190 --> 00:01:23.950
Moo Deok, don't look at me like that

00:01:24.030 --> 00:01:27.240
If you look like that, no one will believe your words

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:29.950
Then, master,

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:34.000
How can I make sure everyone believes in my love?

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:36.830
Well, first of all...

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:40.460
Your look doesn't suit me at all

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:44.130
There should be tenderness in your gaze

00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:47.760
I think it's impossible

00:01:48.970 --> 00:01:50.930
Why did you say you love me?

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:54.310
I should have told you that you like me

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:58.310
Let's say I'll look tenderly

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:00.520
and love you

00:02:00.610 --> 00:02:02.690
What then?

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:04.070
After?

00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:07.030
I love you blindly

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:09.910
while maid Kim is desperately trying to marry you?

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:14.160
What will happen to me?

00:02:14.830 --> 00:02:18.000
Don't worry, I'm not going to get married

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:19.750
He's not going to

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:22.670
Is that why you gave up chastity tea?

00:02:25.050 --> 00:02:28.220
I understand correctly what you are asking for

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:31.310
some kind of promise or something?

00:02:31.390 --> 00:02:33.270
If I love you

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:36.810
that means I have to be sure that you are mine

00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:43.030
Let's not rush things

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:44.030
You refuse

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:48.820
Why is it so difficult with you?

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:52.140
Project coordinator and editor: Ria_Lee

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:51.450
I just asked you to take your time

00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:54.540
I need to talk to maid Kim

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:57.140
Assistant coordinators: Martini, gaarysn

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:55.620
Just look

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:57.370
Forget it

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:02.140
Typesetter translators: Ria_Lee, Alina, Zero Amamiya

00:02:58.460 --> 00:03:00.170
A gentle look for you

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:02.840
I'll look at you like you're a lousy dog

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:04.000
Dog?

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:05.960
Exactly

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:09.510
I forgot to say something important

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:11.930
It was a dog

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:14.060
What are you talking about?

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:17.350
The dog that was with Master Li in Danhyangok. Do you remember?

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:19.230
Sapsari?

00:03:19.310 --> 00:03:20.650
Yes

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:23.020
This is Gwigu

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:30.660
Master Li knew from the very beginning that you were a nomad

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:31.910
Perhaps

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:34.620
he even knows that you are Nak Soo

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:51.760
What brought Chief Jinyeowon to this hour?

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:58.980
She probably came for you

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:01.100
I heard

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:04.650
you took Gwiga, the relic of Jinyowon, to the palace

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:07.530
We were looking for traces of dark magic

00:04:07.610 --> 00:04:12.110
I'm warning you: it's better not to involve Jinyeowon in any business with nomads.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.370
Why does Sosnovy Bor use Jinyeowon?

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:18.580
Mages of the Unified Council

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:20.330
must prevent dark magic

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:24.210
And Jinyoewon must help Sosnovy Bor in this

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:26.460
Do you think so?

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:29.510
So you are using us again

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:33.090
Then I'll take Gwiga

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:35.550
Bring him to me

00:04:36.310 --> 00:04:39.980
Or should I go get him myself?

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:42.190
Gwigu is here

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:55.820
Gwigu - a relic created by master So Kyung

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:57.490
Sosnovy Bor has the same rights to it

00:04:57.580 --> 00:04:59.870
What rights do you have to the Jinyeowon relic?

00:04:59.950 --> 00:05:03.580
Do you want to say that Jinyeowon is the storehouse of Sosnovy Bor?

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:05.420
That's not what he meant

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:09.090
You shamelessly think that all of Jinyeowon's treasures belong to you

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:11.550
You take things without asking and don’t return them.

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:13.930
These are the people of Sosnovy Bor

00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:20.060
You've said that before

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:25.980
That the magician of Sosnovy Bor took something from you

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:34.950
Who was it?

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:48.920
He's right in front of me

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:52.590
He infiltrated Jinyeowon

00:05:52.670 --> 00:05:54.340
and stole Gwiga

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:59.720
How dare you call Master Li a thief?!

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:02.680
What else can you call someone who steals someone else’s property?

00:06:03.350 --> 00:06:05.690
Mother please

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:09.860
Master Li moved Gwigu's soul from a broken urn

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:11.650
into the dog's body

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:13.570
And they smashed that trash can in Sosnovy Bor

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:14.820
Look!

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:18.260
He's dead, master

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:23.720
I protected my daughter

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:27.180
Master Li, did you order Gwig to attack us?

00:07:27.270 --> 00:07:29.850
Gwigu attacked because he sensed dark magic

00:07:33.980 --> 00:07:35.320
This means

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:39.110
that Young Miss Jin is somehow related to her

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:50.000
Probably all because of that worm with dark magic

00:07:56.960 --> 00:07:58.050
Mrs. Jin,

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:00.130
you

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:02.590
used dark magic?

00:08:08.810 --> 00:08:11.020
Dark magic? What nonsense!

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:12.350
If not,

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:14.770
why did Gwigu attack her?

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:18.400
Sosnovy Bor is now trying to slander my daughter

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:19.990
Stop it!

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:22.410
Master Li is right

00:08:25.990 --> 00:08:27.200
Recently

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:31.540
I used dark magic

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:41.380
But I didn't hurt anyone

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:51.600
It's very popular now

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:56.570
This is a talisman for a love spell so that your lover loves you

00:09:02.530 --> 00:09:04.530
I think that's the point

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:15.130
It seems our daughter has caused a misunderstanding

00:09:15.210 --> 00:09:16.290
Sorry

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:43.860
You lived in the body of this dog,

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:46.490
and now he has left us

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:58.670
Gwig is no longer with us

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:02.090
What to do?

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:06.550
Is it my fault that Gwigu died?

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:07.510
Jin Cho Young!

00:10:08.260 --> 00:10:10.640
How dare you disgrace Jinyeowon?

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:36.580
Gwigu died?

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:38.540
Yes

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:41.460
Master Li said he would bury him tomorrow

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:44.710
So it was Gwigu

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:51.140
He knew from the very beginning that I was a nomad

00:10:51.930 --> 00:10:54.180
But he never growled at me

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:58.600
Was he covering for me like that?

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:04.860
Even dead, it's Gwigu

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:08.570
It is unlikely that all the energy left the body. Don't touch

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:19.330
Are Jinyowon's people gone?

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:21.040
They are discussing another problem

00:11:21.630 --> 00:11:22.630
Another problem

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:24.840
It turned out that Dan Gu and Cho Young

00:11:25.880 --> 00:11:27.090
meet

00:11:28.340 --> 00:11:29.590
- What?
- What?

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:33.930
I destroyed Jinyoewon's relic

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:35.890
it's not your fault

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:38.390
It's time for us

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:41.650
- Let's go
- Yes

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:42.980
Mrs. Jin

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:45.320
Have some tea before you leave

00:11:45.900 --> 00:11:48.110
We need to clarify everything, improve relations

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:49.950
Relationships?

00:11:50.030 --> 00:11:51.990
They're in love

00:11:52.070 --> 00:11:54.450
That talisman was intended for Dan Gu,

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:57.160
Am I right?

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:01.790
Yes. I'm the reason for everything

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:04.130
Cho Young didn't do anything wrong

00:12:04.210 --> 00:12:05.210
Shut up

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:09.550
I recently found out

00:12:09.630 --> 00:12:11.430
He said stupid things

00:12:11.510 --> 00:12:14.260
about how they will be together when your deceased daughter returns,

00:12:14.350 --> 00:12:16.100
so I told him off

00:12:16.180 --> 00:12:19.230
Deceased daughter? Boo Young is alive and we will find her soon

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:23.310
Do you really believe that Jin Moo will find her?

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:26.820
He's deceiving you

00:12:27.400 --> 00:12:29.780
It was he who gave you the idea to search Sosnovy Bor

00:12:29.860 --> 00:12:31.700
at this hour to pick up Gwiga?

00:12:31.780 --> 00:12:33.990
I told you not to meddle in Jinyaewon's business.

00:12:34.570 --> 00:12:37.410
Let's not quarrel

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:40.620
It will be wonderful if Boo Young is found

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:44.250
Mrs. Jin does not want to be at enmity with Sosnovy Bor

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:48.760
Let's work together

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:50.300
Who knows?

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:54.010
Maybe Dan Gu and Jo Young will unite two families

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:55.430
I'm against it

00:12:55.510 --> 00:12:58.220
Cho Young will find a better match

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:03.650
Where can you find a better groom than the future head of Sosnovy Bor?

00:13:03.730 --> 00:13:05.270
Daughter of the Jin family

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:08.110
worthy to marry the Crown Prince

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:10.610
Mother,

00:13:10.690 --> 00:13:12.280
what does it mean?

00:13:13.240 --> 00:13:14.450
I don't want

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:17.330
Prince is evil

00:13:17.410 --> 00:13:19.870
- And I don’t like him
- Jin Cho Young

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:22.500
I will marry the one I love

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:24.870
Yes

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:27.420
I'm her lover

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:28.550
Park Dan Gu!

00:13:34.470 --> 00:13:35.640
Let's talk at home

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:40.720
Let go of her hand and let's go

00:13:42.810 --> 00:13:44.520
Let her go now

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:46.440
Let go of her hand so she can leave

00:13:47.730 --> 00:13:49.270
Let him go!

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:50.440
Let go now!

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:00.580
Jin Cho Young

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:03.580
If you don't want to obey, don't come home

00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:15.550
I think it's best we leave

00:14:18.260 --> 00:14:19.890
Will you come home with us?

00:14:19.970 --> 00:14:22.430
This time I won't give in to my mom

00:14:23.680 --> 00:14:25.230
Understand, father

00:14:27.730 --> 00:14:30.400
I'll let you know when your mom calms down

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:33.990
Take care of her for now

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:35.650
Yes

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:47.870
Uncle, sorry for the commotion,

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:49.540
but I will protect my girl

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:50.460
You too get lost!

00:15:00.680 --> 00:15:03.850
Where shall we go now?

00:15:05.980 --> 00:15:07.230
I don't know

00:15:10.730 --> 00:15:12.770
He said not to come home

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:15.690
we can go to the inn and...

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:18.240
- Rent a room?
- What?

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:21.780
That's not what I meant!

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:24.700
Not one, but two different ones

00:15:27.960 --> 00:15:30.330
I don't like inns

00:15:32.090 --> 00:15:35.000
There's nowhere else to go for now

00:15:35.090 --> 00:15:36.590
And it's getting colder

00:15:37.340 --> 00:15:38.380
It's cold...

00:15:40.890 --> 00:15:42.180
Where should I go?

00:15:42.260 --> 00:15:43.640
Mister Pak!

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:48.390
I was told that Mr. Chan was released, but he is not in the room.

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:49.810
Have you seen him?

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:56.730
Is something wrong?

00:15:59.860 --> 00:16:01.950
- Maid Kim...
- What?

00:16:02.030 --> 00:16:03.030
Maid Kim...

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:05.030
Let me go, Mr. Park

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:08.330
Mrs. Jin, what is it?

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:10.040
Maid Kim...

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:12.580
Gwigu, who organized a pogrom in the palace,

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:16.380
destroyed by Mrs. Jin in an attempt to stop him

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:18.210
Gwigu destroyed?

00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:20.180
Why destroy what defines dark magic?

00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:22.640
Definition of dark magic

00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:25.680
was just an excuse for Sosnovy Bor to threaten the palace

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:27.890
Jin Moo is right

00:16:27.970 --> 00:16:31.520
Sosnovy Bor tried to show that it is more influential than us

00:16:32.810 --> 00:16:34.690
Under the pretext of eradicating evil,

00:16:34.770 --> 00:16:37.280
Sosnovy Bor can convene the magicians of the Unified Council

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:39.320
and remove the king

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:42.280
Is that why they mentioned the King's star?

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:45.410
Warning that they might overthrow me?

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:49.200
Master Li spoke about the star to explain

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:52.830
that someone like Master Seo Kyung will appear to protect us in difficult times

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:54.790
No one threatened us

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:58.170
What if the savior wants to rule over us?

00:16:59.050 --> 00:17:00.420
Can you stop him?

00:17:02.010 --> 00:17:03.590
Gwangju Chang Gang

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:05.390
predicted the appearance of a star

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:07.470
Master Li said the same thing

00:17:08.970 --> 00:17:11.890
Does Sosnovoy Bor know this too?

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:23.910
At first he took concubines to conceive a son under this star

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:26.490
Now he is trying to find him in Sosnovy Bor

00:17:27.280 --> 00:17:29.580
It is natural for a king to be constantly on guard

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:32.250
For the royal family of Guo

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:35.460
the existence of the King's star is a sign of betrayal

00:17:42.590 --> 00:17:43.680
"Treason"?

00:17:44.550 --> 00:17:47.430
The people of Deho believe in the power of heaven and revere it,

00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:50.770
but a centuries-old dynasty does not change so easily

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:53.520
It's stupid to think that someone will become king

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:54.940
only because of the star

00:17:55.020 --> 00:17:57.730
If he is from Sosnovy Bor, it is possible

00:17:58.900 --> 00:18:01.900
Master Seo Kyung saved the world two hundred years ago

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:06.740
They still honor him in Daeho

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:10.870
If someone was born under the same star as Master So Kyung,

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:15.620
this will be enough to take the throne

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:19.040
Do you think

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:23.090
Are the king's worries not groundless?

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:27.050
Don't worry

00:18:27.930 --> 00:18:32.560
This won't happen as long as I'm here

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:38.560
Okay

00:18:38.650 --> 00:18:43.190
I won't be as stupid as my father and live in eternal fear

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:49.910
When I brought Gwiga to the palace,

00:18:50.660 --> 00:18:52.580
I realized that you were right

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:55.910
The Queen is on Jin Mu's side

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:59.960
We can't provoke the royal family yet

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:02.380
If we try to do anything,

00:19:02.460 --> 00:19:05.550
Jin Mu will definitely reveal the secret of Wook's birth

00:19:05.630 --> 00:19:07.970
and make him an enemy of the palace

00:19:08.720 --> 00:19:11.680
And then everyone in Sosnovy Bor will become enemies,

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:13.350
because they accepted it

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:15.770
We need Chang Gan

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:19.520
Only he knows the whole truth

00:19:20.150 --> 00:19:22.570
Like Jin Mu's weaknesses

00:19:22.650 --> 00:19:27.030
How do you find someone who has been hiding for two decades?

00:19:27.610 --> 00:19:30.110
Let's wait until he returns on his own

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:35.080
Rumors about nomads spread far beyond the walls of the Deho fortress

00:19:35.160 --> 00:19:38.250
He will return when he hears them,

00:19:38.330 --> 00:19:43.170
out of fear for Sosnovy Bor and for his son

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:23.670
I heard they were looking for me

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:25.250
Where is Master Li?

00:20:27.170 --> 00:20:29.380
He left for Danhyangok at dawn,

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:31.340
to burn Sapsari

00:20:31.930 --> 00:20:32.840
What?

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:36.390
Is he not there? Wasn't he the one who called me?

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:37.890
He

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:41.480
Said to give this to you

00:20:44.190 --> 00:20:48.440
This is Nak Soo's sword, which he took from the Crown Prince.

00:20:49.610 --> 00:20:52.110
In his words, you are the only one who can keep it,

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:53.910
that's why I asked to give it back

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:56.490
Left your sword?

00:20:57.410 --> 00:20:59.830
Didn't he say anything before leaving?

00:20:59.910 --> 00:21:03.080
You are not his student, why then?

00:21:03.170 --> 00:21:06.380
he cares about you so much, I don’t understand

00:21:06.880 --> 00:21:08.670
You haven't even practiced chastity!

00:21:10.880 --> 00:21:14.220
Park Jin said that you are a womanizer

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:16.550
If you were in love with Moo Deok,

00:21:16.640 --> 00:21:18.390
Why did you spud my Young Ok?

00:21:19.890 --> 00:21:22.270
- I didn’t spud
- No?

00:21:22.350 --> 00:21:23.690
You charmed her

00:21:23.770 --> 00:21:26.650
How did you charm Master Li?

00:21:26.730 --> 00:21:28.480
I didn't do anything

00:21:28.570 --> 00:21:31.610
That someone is kind to me

00:21:31.690 --> 00:21:33.780
doesn't mean I charmed them

00:21:35.070 --> 00:21:38.120
Be careful with Young Ok in future

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:39.830
and respectful to Master Li

00:21:39.910 --> 00:21:40.950
Yes

00:21:41.040 --> 00:21:44.620
Master Li is not as narrow-minded as other teachers

00:21:44.710 --> 00:21:47.880
He is open-minded and kind

00:21:47.960 --> 00:21:49.550
I respect him

00:21:50.380 --> 00:21:53.510
You can't even imagine how strict he can be

00:21:54.430 --> 00:21:58.600
He is merciless to couch potatoes

00:21:58.680 --> 00:22:01.430
So always be on your guard

00:22:01.520 --> 00:22:02.640
Take it and go

00:22:09.690 --> 00:22:10.780
I completely forgot

00:22:10.860 --> 00:22:12.440
Almost got myself into trouble again

00:22:12.530 --> 00:22:14.570
I was asked to convey a message

00:22:14.650 --> 00:22:17.200
when will I give you the sword Nak Soo

00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:31.300
Why did he give you my sword?

00:22:31.880 --> 00:22:34.090
Because you are mine

00:22:34.840 --> 00:22:36.680
and that means the sword too

00:22:37.590 --> 00:22:40.640
In any case, this means that he will continue to remain silent

00:22:40.720 --> 00:22:42.060
It's good

00:22:47.520 --> 00:22:50.270
I was asked to convey a message

00:22:55.110 --> 00:22:57.490
Chan Wook must take care of him

00:22:57.570 --> 00:23:01.450
If anyone tries to use the sword, he must kill him

00:23:03.580 --> 00:23:05.410
If he doesn't do it,

00:23:07.670 --> 00:23:09.500
he will die too

00:23:12.670 --> 00:23:16.670
It was a warning that he would kill us if Moo Deok used the sword.

00:23:17.590 --> 00:23:19.010
as mercenary Nak Soo

00:23:23.560 --> 00:23:25.730
The sword is mine, but it feels strange

00:23:27.020 --> 00:23:29.600
I think he let me live because he knows I can't take advantage of him.

00:23:30.690 --> 00:23:33.270
So as Moo Deok you will be safe

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:36.360
If I become Nak Soo, I'll be in danger

00:23:37.400 --> 00:23:39.660
Once I find the ice stone and regain my energy,

00:23:40.360 --> 00:23:42.450
I will also make enemies

00:23:44.330 --> 00:23:45.830
What will happen to me then

00:23:46.450 --> 00:23:47.960
shouldn't concern you

00:23:48.040 --> 00:23:49.000
Why?

00:23:49.710 --> 00:23:51.880
Because we will no longer be teacher and student?

00:23:51.960 --> 00:23:54.300
You won't have to protect me anymore

00:23:54.380 --> 00:23:56.340
and I won't have to give in

00:23:57.720 --> 00:24:00.130
That was our agreement

00:24:07.810 --> 00:24:09.390
Then promise me one more thing

00:24:10.100 --> 00:24:12.400
Out of a sense of duty and loyalty,

00:24:12.480 --> 00:24:16.530
and so-called love, can you promise me one more thing?

00:24:18.070 --> 00:24:19.860
Fine. What do you want?

00:24:20.570 --> 00:24:22.110
If you return the energy,

00:24:22.740 --> 00:24:25.280
you'll have to point a sword at someone,

00:24:26.370 --> 00:24:28.120
let me be the first

00:24:31.170 --> 00:24:32.210
If I die,

00:24:32.830 --> 00:24:37.630
it means that a murderer took my life

00:24:41.380 --> 00:24:42.720
If not,

00:24:43.640 --> 00:24:45.760
I'll give you another promise

00:24:47.520 --> 00:24:49.390
Something like a promise

00:24:49.480 --> 00:24:53.770
which you wanted to hear from me about our future

00:25:02.200 --> 00:25:05.530
I will find the ice stone and you will not go wild,

00:25:06.950 --> 00:25:08.540
because I promised you

00:25:19.710 --> 00:25:21.420
Runaway couple

00:25:22.470 --> 00:25:23.930
will remain

00:25:25.760 --> 00:25:28.010
Is Dan Gu here?

00:25:30.560 --> 00:25:34.690
Why did you let them in?

00:25:34.770 --> 00:25:35.940
It was necessary

00:25:36.020 --> 00:25:37.860
let them go to the city,

00:25:37.940 --> 00:25:41.360
so that they build a love nest for the amusement of the whole city?

00:25:43.400 --> 00:25:44.610
Maid Kim,

00:25:44.700 --> 00:25:47.780
I'm humbled and grateful

00:25:47.870 --> 00:25:50.290
They are a very cute couple

00:25:50.370 --> 00:25:52.120
Why are you so against it?

00:25:52.200 --> 00:25:54.460
They can't get married

00:25:54.540 --> 00:25:56.330
And that's why you kicked them out?

00:25:56.920 --> 00:25:58.750
Quit this terrible habit

00:25:59.880 --> 00:26:03.340
Last night you held Moo Deok and Master for no reason

00:26:03.420 --> 00:26:05.630
With age you need to become more tolerant

00:26:06.220 --> 00:26:07.340
Same for me...

00:26:09.180 --> 00:26:11.350
I love Moo Deok

00:26:11.430 --> 00:26:14.350
I love the owner very much

00:26:15.230 --> 00:26:16.150
Maid Kim

00:26:16.900 --> 00:26:19.360
If Wook, like Dan Gu,

00:26:20.730 --> 00:26:23.530
loves someone he shouldn't,

00:26:24.200 --> 00:26:25.150
what will you do?

00:26:25.240 --> 00:26:27.240
Will you be tolerant?

00:26:31.790 --> 00:26:35.330
I will support any choice of Mr.

00:26:35.410 --> 00:26:37.170
- Really?
- Of course

00:26:40.090 --> 00:26:41.130
I have no doubt

00:26:41.750 --> 00:26:43.840
I know perfectly well what's bothering you

00:26:43.920 --> 00:26:46.880
date of birth, appearance, age and all that

00:26:46.970 --> 00:26:48.550
The heart is most important

00:26:49.140 --> 00:26:52.060
If you're in love, looks don't matter

00:26:52.810 --> 00:26:55.180
Even if she's not pretty

00:26:55.270 --> 00:26:57.650
or if they have a big age difference

00:27:03.820 --> 00:27:07.320
So that's what you think

00:27:08.490 --> 00:27:09.620
yes?

00:27:09.700 --> 00:27:10.870
What?

00:27:14.250 --> 00:27:17.710
Anyone who is not as handsome as Chang Gang

00:27:18.620 --> 00:27:20.250
and who is much older,

00:27:20.330 --> 00:27:23.840
would still have a chance

00:27:25.340 --> 00:27:26.720
if your heart is touched?

00:27:28.470 --> 00:27:29.590
Well...

00:27:33.010 --> 00:27:34.560
If my heart is touched

00:27:36.270 --> 00:27:39.140
he would be much more handsome

00:27:39.230 --> 00:27:40.520
and younger in my eyes

00:27:53.280 --> 00:27:56.040
Got it, Maid Kim

00:27:57.330 --> 00:27:58.580
I understand you

00:28:16.310 --> 00:28:21.190
He was very open when he asked about my feelings for him

00:28:22.610 --> 00:28:24.820
And what does “not beautiful” mean?

00:28:24.900 --> 00:28:26.900
He's only two years older

00:28:30.070 --> 00:28:31.780
Worries out of nowhere

00:28:42.420 --> 00:28:46.550
How can she tell me so easily

00:28:46.630 --> 00:28:48.380
What does Master Li love?

00:28:52.430 --> 00:28:54.140
Is he handsome?

00:28:56.060 --> 00:28:59.480
He is more than a hundred years older than her

00:29:09.940 --> 00:29:11.110
Park Dan Goo...

00:29:11.780 --> 00:29:13.700
You little bastard!

00:29:17.490 --> 00:29:18.830
Now

00:29:20.200 --> 00:29:23.960
I would prefer my uncle's hidden wine

00:29:25.130 --> 00:29:26.380
instead of this tea

00:29:26.460 --> 00:29:28.920
What? Already regretting it?

00:29:29.510 --> 00:29:30.550
No!

00:29:31.220 --> 00:29:34.550
I thought I could give it all up

00:29:34.640 --> 00:29:37.390
So I took her hand then

00:29:39.640 --> 00:29:42.940
I didn't expect him to grab my hand so suddenly

00:29:43.690 --> 00:29:46.610
I was just upset that they were talking about the Crown Prince

00:29:46.690 --> 00:29:49.110
And I said I don't like him

00:29:49.730 --> 00:29:52.110
And he suddenly grabbed my hand and confessed his love

00:29:52.190 --> 00:29:53.450
Move it a little

00:29:56.490 --> 00:29:58.660
I couldn't let go of his hand

00:29:58.740 --> 00:30:00.830
I'm just really confused

00:30:01.750 --> 00:30:04.420
I never even thought about running away from home.

00:30:06.040 --> 00:30:07.710
How long will you be here?

00:30:09.250 --> 00:30:11.760
I was told to serve you both while you're here

00:30:14.010 --> 00:30:15.470
No idea

00:30:15.550 --> 00:30:17.680
I don't want to stay here

00:30:18.550 --> 00:30:21.810
If I tell you that we should go home,

00:30:21.890 --> 00:30:24.060
then I'll look irresponsible, right?

00:30:24.140 --> 00:30:27.060
If I say I want to go home, I'll break his heart, right?

00:30:28.110 --> 00:30:29.770
- What should I do?
- What should I do?

00:30:31.480 --> 00:30:33.030
Everything is for the better

00:30:33.110 --> 00:30:35.200
Serve Lady Jin here

00:30:35.280 --> 00:30:37.660
better than meeting Park Jin in Sosnovy Bor

00:30:37.740 --> 00:30:42.240
If So Yi is behind the murders you're accused of,

00:30:42.870 --> 00:30:44.000
then it's dangerous

00:30:44.080 --> 00:30:47.790
You don't know her, but she knows Moo Deok

00:30:49.710 --> 00:30:52.670
Why does So Yi go around killing people?

00:30:56.550 --> 00:30:58.720
If the blind girl those bandits were looking for

00:30:58.800 --> 00:31:00.680
This is the same So Yi

00:31:01.180 --> 00:31:02.930
then she couldn't kill them herself

00:31:03.020 --> 00:31:04.520
I think she had an accomplice

00:31:04.600 --> 00:31:07.810
If the authorities take these bodies, they will catch the killer

00:31:08.600 --> 00:31:10.270
Moo Deok knew So Yi

00:31:10.360 --> 00:31:12.610
She should help with the investigation.

00:31:13.820 --> 00:31:15.530
She doesn't recognize So Yi

00:31:15.610 --> 00:31:18.070
She is not the same Moo Deok who lived in Sari Village

00:31:18.160 --> 00:31:21.080
She will be falsely accused and suffer

00:31:21.160 --> 00:31:24.040
If necessary, I will ask her myself

00:31:31.130 --> 00:31:34.380
It's better not to interfere. Yul knows what he's doing

00:31:41.800 --> 00:31:44.600
There'll be trouble if the deputy finds out you're not home.

00:31:45.100 --> 00:31:47.850
Everyone who knew me is killed

00:31:47.940 --> 00:31:50.190
When I arrive in Jinyeowon, I still have to get out

00:31:50.270 --> 00:31:52.400
I have to practice so that they believe me.

00:31:53.520 --> 00:31:54.980
Buy what you want

00:31:55.070 --> 00:31:56.990
I gave you a lot of money

00:31:58.530 --> 00:32:00.110
Let's come back soon

00:32:01.450 --> 00:32:02.700
Wait

00:32:03.580 --> 00:32:05.830
Why do you use an umbrella instead of a cane?

00:32:07.830 --> 00:32:09.000
Don't touch

00:32:11.000 --> 00:32:12.380
I like it so much

00:32:24.350 --> 00:32:27.220
You helped clear my name

00:32:27.310 --> 00:32:29.600
Hope you enjoy it here

00:32:29.690 --> 00:32:31.940
Does the Chan family always eat like this?

00:32:33.190 --> 00:32:34.400
Too fat

00:32:37.730 --> 00:32:40.650
Okay, madam. I'll cook something else

00:32:49.910 --> 00:32:51.670
Too salty!

00:32:54.080 --> 00:32:56.040
- Fresh?
- Salty

00:32:56.130 --> 00:32:58.340
My stomach is bloated from saltiness

00:33:01.050 --> 00:33:02.300
Okay, madam

00:33:05.350 --> 00:33:06.430
Too hard

00:33:06.510 --> 00:33:08.350
Too sweet

00:33:09.560 --> 00:33:10.850
What is this?

00:33:12.100 --> 00:33:13.940
I'm so worried I've lost my appetite

00:33:15.980 --> 00:33:19.190
Why is she acting like Uk?

00:33:19.900 --> 00:33:21.200
I have no appetite

00:33:21.280 --> 00:33:22.780
Is there anything to drink?

00:33:22.860 --> 00:33:24.450
Cinnamon tea or seekhe*

00:33:22.860 --> 00:33:24.450
*sweet rice drink

00:33:29.950 --> 00:33:32.540
They are simply made for each other. We should have gotten married!

00:33:32.620 --> 00:33:36.130
Then one of them would definitely die in a fight

00:33:40.920 --> 00:33:42.090
Moo Dok, Sikhye...

00:33:42.170 --> 00:33:44.300
Sweet? Too cold?

00:33:44.930 --> 00:33:47.050
That's how he should be

00:33:47.760 --> 00:33:49.430
Why are you screaming?

00:33:49.520 --> 00:33:51.060
Tired of serving me?

00:33:51.930 --> 00:33:54.100
Do you think you're easy to please?

00:33:56.520 --> 00:33:58.770
I get irritable when I'm worried

00:33:58.860 --> 00:34:00.820
Being away from home is very tiring

00:34:00.900 --> 00:34:02.690
Then go home

00:34:03.740 --> 00:34:06.490
No, I'm afraid

00:34:06.570 --> 00:34:08.530
Mom is very angry with me

00:34:10.040 --> 00:34:13.410
What kind of daughter are you?

00:34:13.500 --> 00:34:15.420
I was never her favorite

00:34:16.580 --> 00:34:18.750
My sister was her pride and joy

00:34:20.630 --> 00:34:22.630
Even though she was blind,

00:34:22.710 --> 00:34:24.720
saw energy and communicated with relics

00:34:24.800 --> 00:34:27.550
She was as strong as her mother even at a young age.

00:34:27.640 --> 00:34:30.470
Well, I heard that the Jin family members are mostly

00:34:30.560 --> 00:34:33.350
control the power of heaven, not cast spells

00:34:33.930 --> 00:34:36.100
You saw how I treated Gwigu, right?

00:34:36.770 --> 00:34:38.310
That's right

00:34:38.400 --> 00:34:40.190
Strong Priestess

00:34:40.270 --> 00:34:43.690
can control people's souls and lure them into traps

00:34:44.610 --> 00:34:46.950
- Luring into traps?
- Yes

00:34:47.030 --> 00:34:49.070
If the priestess traps the forces,

00:34:49.160 --> 00:34:52.660
even the most powerful magician cannot escape

00:34:54.580 --> 00:34:57.000
I heard that shamans can

00:34:57.080 --> 00:34:59.250
erase and change memories

00:34:59.330 --> 00:35:02.050
Priestesses of Jinyeowon on another level

00:35:02.130 --> 00:35:05.260
And how did such a girl die?

00:35:06.800 --> 00:35:08.340
She's truly incredible

00:35:10.050 --> 00:35:12.060
She's definitely alive

00:35:13.890 --> 00:35:15.520
And we will see her again

00:35:21.770 --> 00:35:23.190
If she's alive

00:35:24.150 --> 00:35:25.570
you will see, without a doubt

00:35:34.410 --> 00:35:37.370
Uncle asked about Moo Deok

00:35:37.960 --> 00:35:40.880
Did he ask the merchant about her?

00:35:41.750 --> 00:35:43.500
Yes. Moo Deok told

00:35:45.510 --> 00:35:47.920
All because of that incident with the nomad

00:35:48.510 --> 00:35:49.430
You're right

00:35:49.510 --> 00:35:53.810
If there are nomads in the palace, they may be in Sosnovy Bor too

00:35:54.680 --> 00:35:58.520
Why does Sosnovy Bor's exiled successor care about this?

00:35:58.600 --> 00:36:02.730
- I'm not expelled
- He already regrets it

00:36:02.810 --> 00:36:03.650
Hey

00:36:03.730 --> 00:36:06.070
You were so confident yesterday

00:36:08.400 --> 00:36:10.030
Uka always gets kicked out

00:36:10.110 --> 00:36:11.530
What am I doing here?

00:36:11.620 --> 00:36:13.740
You'll get used to it

00:36:13.830 --> 00:36:17.040
Well, it will be sad at first

00:36:18.660 --> 00:36:20.580
Only Yul did not go through this

00:36:20.670 --> 00:36:21.830
What are you talking about?

00:36:21.920 --> 00:36:23.000
Yulia was kicked out too

00:36:23.090 --> 00:36:24.170
It can't be

00:36:24.880 --> 00:36:27.050
Remember, I broke the gold-plated ink stone,

00:36:27.130 --> 00:36:28.630
and we all lied?

00:36:33.760 --> 00:36:37.140
Uncle will be very angry with me

00:36:37.720 --> 00:36:38.600
Let's hide it

00:36:39.560 --> 00:36:41.650
Let's bury it and pretend we don't know anything

00:36:42.230 --> 00:36:43.440
This is wrong

00:36:44.270 --> 00:36:46.570
We must tell the truth and ask for forgiveness

00:36:46.650 --> 00:36:49.740
Then Dan Gu will be in big trouble.

00:36:52.780 --> 00:36:54.780
I can't lie

00:36:56.330 --> 00:36:58.080
Everything will be fine, Dan Gu

00:36:58.950 --> 00:37:00.580
We can handle it

00:37:02.790 --> 00:37:06.460
We all agreed to hide it

00:37:06.550 --> 00:37:08.960
But after that Yul fell ill

00:37:09.550 --> 00:37:12.510
I think Yul is very sick

00:37:12.590 --> 00:37:13.800
I think so too

00:37:15.720 --> 00:37:20.060
Why did Yul get so sick? What's happened?

00:37:20.640 --> 00:37:24.150
I heard he doesn't eat well and doesn't sleep well.

00:37:24.230 --> 00:37:25.310
What happened?

00:37:26.690 --> 00:37:29.740
Yul has never done anything wrong

00:37:29.820 --> 00:37:32.240
He got sick, worried that we'd get caught

00:37:33.070 --> 00:37:36.450
We confessed to the crime because we thought Yul would die

00:37:36.530 --> 00:37:38.660
And we were all kicked out

00:37:38.740 --> 00:37:42.040
I've been kicked out so many times I can't even remember

00:37:42.120 --> 00:37:45.670
But I doubt that Yul was sick because of the fear of being caught

00:37:47.090 --> 00:37:49.800
He suffered because he realized that he had done wrong

00:37:50.460 --> 00:37:53.630
and it was difficult for him to accept this fact

00:37:57.970 --> 00:38:00.140
He gets lost if he's caught off guard

00:38:01.850 --> 00:38:04.810
He must have been worried and afraid to do...

00:38:05.600 --> 00:38:07.110
something is wrong

00:38:08.690 --> 00:38:10.190
for the sake of your friends

00:38:15.320 --> 00:38:17.780
Yes. I remember it very well

00:38:19.120 --> 00:38:20.540
It tormented me

00:38:21.620 --> 00:38:23.540
Punish yourself more severely

00:38:23.620 --> 00:38:26.500
than others

00:38:26.580 --> 00:38:28.840
Is this some kind of heightened sense of morality?

00:38:29.540 --> 00:38:32.300
Were you like this as a child?

00:38:32.380 --> 00:38:33.420
Incredible

00:38:35.090 --> 00:38:37.840
Imagine how I felt when I buried that stone with my

00:38:37.930 --> 00:38:39.350
irresponsible friends?

00:38:40.680 --> 00:38:43.180
We couldn't even bury it properly. We were quickly discovered

00:38:43.270 --> 00:38:44.560
- What?
- What?

00:38:44.640 --> 00:38:47.350
Have we been exposed? You said, we confessed ourselves

00:38:47.940 --> 00:38:49.940
Dan Gu doesn't remember quite right

00:38:50.020 --> 00:38:51.440
We didn't confess

00:38:52.480 --> 00:38:55.900
Sang Ho found a half-buried stone. That's how we were discovered

00:38:56.530 --> 00:38:57.660
Is this true?

00:38:58.240 --> 00:38:59.740
Apparently I embellished it a little

00:39:01.120 --> 00:39:03.410
I thought we did the honorable thing

00:39:03.500 --> 00:39:05.080
What a shame...

00:39:05.160 --> 00:39:08.000
What to be ashamed of?

00:39:08.080 --> 00:39:10.210
You were kicked out recently

00:39:10.290 --> 00:39:13.000
Who will be the next head instead of Dan Gu?

00:39:14.260 --> 00:39:15.170
Maybe Sun Ho?

00:39:15.260 --> 00:39:16.630
Do you think so?

00:39:16.720 --> 00:39:19.010
Then I'll be on his side

00:39:19.970 --> 00:39:22.220
You can't give up on me like this

00:39:22.310 --> 00:39:24.220
You should be on my side actually

00:39:24.310 --> 00:39:26.180
Come on, Uk

00:39:26.270 --> 00:39:28.810
I can't really help

00:39:29.650 --> 00:39:32.610
- Hey, Yul
- I'm not too eloquent

00:39:33.110 --> 00:39:34.320
Especially in love

00:39:42.910 --> 00:39:44.410
Of course you're both on my side

00:40:02.760 --> 00:40:05.560
Yulia, have you been sleeping well lately?

00:40:05.640 --> 00:40:08.640
Today you can drink as much as you want

00:40:08.730 --> 00:40:10.730
And then get some good sleep

00:40:12.060 --> 00:40:14.070
Do you have trouble sleeping?

00:40:14.690 --> 00:40:15.690
No

00:40:15.780 --> 00:40:17.360
I saw you wandering around late

00:40:17.440 --> 00:40:19.240
You usually go to bed early

00:40:19.320 --> 00:40:22.620
Worried about what's going on in Soho Fortress?

00:40:29.920 --> 00:40:32.380
I just killed a nomad

00:40:33.750 --> 00:40:35.840
Protect the world from monsters -

00:40:36.840 --> 00:40:38.340
our duty

00:40:39.970 --> 00:40:41.890
Even dead, it's Gwigu

00:40:42.430 --> 00:40:43.850
It’s unlikely that all the energy has left the body

00:40:43.930 --> 00:40:45.430
Don't touch

00:40:52.560 --> 00:40:54.610
Pretending you don't know anything?

00:40:58.070 --> 00:41:00.030
Like in childhood, when they buried a stone

00:41:01.360 --> 00:41:04.370
It must be hard for you

00:41:22.590 --> 00:41:24.800
If my strength returns and I draw my sword,

00:41:26.850 --> 00:41:30.890
Will I be able to kill again as ruthlessly as before?

00:41:35.690 --> 00:41:37.440
Is this the killer's sword?

00:41:39.030 --> 00:41:41.320
Why did the master bring him here again?

00:41:42.320 --> 00:41:45.820
It gives me goosebumps

00:41:46.910 --> 00:41:48.950
So sinister. It would be better if he wasn't here

00:41:51.330 --> 00:41:54.330
The guests have already fallen asleep. Go to bed

00:41:55.000 --> 00:41:56.630
Maybe make some kind of talisman...

00:42:06.800 --> 00:42:08.180
You give me goosebumps...

00:42:11.220 --> 00:42:12.430
and you seem sinister

00:42:42.800 --> 00:42:44.880
After what happened in Jeonbugwan,

00:42:44.970 --> 00:42:46.720
eunuch Kim is not seen with the queen

00:42:47.680 --> 00:42:49.050
Do you know anything about this?

00:42:49.140 --> 00:42:52.390
They say he is sick and resting. But no one knows exactly where he is

00:42:54.180 --> 00:42:56.390
Find out as much as you can about him

00:42:56.480 --> 00:42:57.980
When he appeared in the palace,

00:42:58.060 --> 00:43:01.110
when he started serving the queen, there were some strange things with him

00:43:01.940 --> 00:43:03.360
Be careful

00:43:04.070 --> 00:43:04.990
Okay, Your Highness

00:43:11.030 --> 00:43:14.500
Do you remember what Eunuch Kim said when we met him in Jeonbugwan?

00:43:16.750 --> 00:43:18.920
This shaman Choi...

00:43:19.580 --> 00:43:21.540
told you to kill me?

00:43:22.090 --> 00:43:23.800
Shaman Choi...

00:43:23.880 --> 00:43:26.970
Her position must be higher than Jin Moo's, so she gives him orders

00:43:28.010 --> 00:43:29.720
Queen?

00:43:29.800 --> 00:43:32.510
Nak Soo in Moo Deok's body

00:43:32.600 --> 00:43:34.270
Maybe in the queen's body

00:43:35.310 --> 00:43:37.020
soul of shaman Choi?

00:43:37.100 --> 00:43:37.980
Quite possible

00:43:39.400 --> 00:43:42.270
But only if the queen is a nomad

00:43:43.360 --> 00:43:47.320
I didn't notice anything that would suggest that the queen is a nomad

00:43:47.400 --> 00:43:50.410
Checking her energy core during inspection,

00:43:50.490 --> 00:43:53.410
I didn't notice anything unusual. She's an ordinary person

00:43:55.700 --> 00:44:00.130
That's what it would seem like if she had an ice stone.

00:44:01.750 --> 00:44:05.670
The Queen is General So's younger sister

00:44:05.760 --> 00:44:07.170
She is Aunt Julia

00:44:07.260 --> 00:44:10.840
She is not related to the Huo family in any way, but belongs to the So family

00:44:10.930 --> 00:44:12.390
If her soul was relocated,

00:44:13.390 --> 00:44:17.230
now the soul of someone else is in her body

00:44:17.310 --> 00:44:20.480
It turns out that the queen’s soul died?

00:44:21.060 --> 00:44:22.520
This is impossible

00:44:22.610 --> 00:44:25.820
Each member of the So family has a Lantern of Life

00:44:27.190 --> 00:44:30.740
The Soho Fortress, on the border, is guarded by the So family. They fight often

00:44:30.820 --> 00:44:34.660
Everyone has their own lantern, which burns due to the owner’s vital energy

00:44:34.740 --> 00:44:36.450
So they know for sure who is alive and who is not

00:44:37.580 --> 00:44:39.790
If the queen died

00:44:40.290 --> 00:44:42.830
they would immediately know about it because of her Life Lantern

00:44:43.840 --> 00:44:46.960
Exactly, I remember those lanterns

00:44:47.050 --> 00:44:51.090
Her soul can live in another body

00:44:52.800 --> 00:44:57.770
As in the case of Master Kang of Daegantonggun, he is now in Sejukwon

00:45:00.690 --> 00:45:05.060
Are you sure the queen is a nomad?

00:45:06.650 --> 00:45:08.320
If we knew this for sure,

00:45:09.320 --> 00:45:12.740
this would mean that we have found Jin Mu's biggest weakness

00:45:15.990 --> 00:45:18.200
They suspect me in Sosnovy Bor

00:45:18.290 --> 00:45:21.250
They will try to prove that the queen is a nomad

00:45:21.330 --> 00:45:22.870
Then what should we worry about?

00:45:23.920 --> 00:45:27.210
We have already chosen the body into which we will transfer her soul

00:45:32.430 --> 00:45:36.350
Can you take her to Jinyeowon without any problems?

00:45:37.600 --> 00:45:39.310
I'll bring her there today

00:45:39.970 --> 00:45:42.230
If everything goes according to plan,

00:45:42.810 --> 00:45:45.360
Jinyeowon will get their lost daughter back

00:45:46.020 --> 00:45:48.520
And the funeral will take place in the palace

00:45:50.570 --> 00:45:53.780
Because the queen honors

00:45:56.490 --> 00:46:01.120
What are we going to do with my previous body, which contains the soul of the queen?

00:46:03.250 --> 00:46:06.080
We don't need it anymore. We'll take care of him

00:46:48.670 --> 00:46:51.840
Your Majesty, today I came to you instead of eunuch Kim

00:47:00.470 --> 00:47:01.850
What a shame

00:47:02.680 --> 00:47:06.560
It would be much easier for you if your mind left you

00:47:28.620 --> 00:47:30.330
This must be Gema village

00:47:31.130 --> 00:47:33.210
Are you looking for a shaman?

00:47:33.300 --> 00:47:34.300
Yes

00:47:35.130 --> 00:47:37.010
Then look in Gema village

00:47:37.590 --> 00:47:40.930
There are many shamans living there

00:47:41.510 --> 00:47:44.100
I know the oldest shaman

00:47:44.680 --> 00:47:47.480
If you are looking for someone, ask him

00:47:50.900 --> 00:47:52.270
- Fire Priestess...
- No, thank you

00:47:54.480 --> 00:47:58.490
Excuse me, do you know where the shaman Bon's house is?

00:47:58.570 --> 00:47:59.910
Shaman Bon?

00:47:59.990 --> 00:48:02.240
He lost his powers

00:48:02.330 --> 00:48:03.990
You better go to the Fire Priestess

00:48:04.080 --> 00:48:06.870
- I'll take you to her
- No, I'm looking for the shaman Bon

00:48:06.950 --> 00:48:10.000
- I'm telling you, he's good for nothing.
- But I need him

00:48:10.920 --> 00:48:11.920
Thank you

00:48:24.060 --> 00:48:26.020
Where am I?

00:48:26.560 --> 00:48:28.640
All streets are the same

00:48:32.400 --> 00:48:35.360
I wasn't going to see the Fire Priestess!

00:48:35.440 --> 00:48:38.190
But you still have to pay since you got your fortune.

00:48:38.280 --> 00:48:40.700
-Where are you going?
- Don't touch!

00:48:41.200 --> 00:48:43.450
She didn't say a word that was true. What to pay for?

00:48:49.910 --> 00:48:51.620
Have you visited the shaman Bon?

00:48:51.710 --> 00:48:53.000
He's bad, right?

00:48:53.080 --> 00:48:56.050
Fire Priestess is the best. Yes?

00:48:56.130 --> 00:48:57.760
"Fire Priestess", yeah, of course

00:48:57.840 --> 00:48:58.920
Wait

00:49:04.050 --> 00:49:06.430
Have you come for a prediction?

00:49:07.390 --> 00:49:09.390
What about yourself? Do you want to perform an exorcism?

00:49:10.020 --> 00:49:12.810
What did the Fire Priestess say to make you so angry?

00:49:13.440 --> 00:49:16.900
That I won’t see any luck in governing, it’s better to go into a craft

00:49:16.980 --> 00:49:18.360
I am the Crown Prince

00:49:19.820 --> 00:49:21.530
What did Shaman Bon tell you?

00:49:21.610 --> 00:49:23.950
I'm just going to him. I have a lot of questions

00:49:26.740 --> 00:49:27.790
Chan Wook

00:49:30.960 --> 00:49:33.170
Are you also looking for Eunuch Kim?

00:49:36.420 --> 00:49:38.340
Why are you looking for it here?

00:49:42.050 --> 00:49:45.390
After that incident in Jeonbugwan, he disappeared from the palace

00:49:46.220 --> 00:49:48.180
His tracks led me here

00:49:48.260 --> 00:49:51.600
So you came here alone, without security?

00:49:53.390 --> 00:49:55.230
I don't want anyone to know

00:49:56.190 --> 00:49:57.900
that I suspect him

00:50:00.940 --> 00:50:02.990
So you agree that he is a nomad,

00:50:04.070 --> 00:50:06.950
and the queen is acting weird trying to hide it?

00:50:08.870 --> 00:50:09.950
That's right

00:50:11.160 --> 00:50:13.120
What about you? What are you looking for?

00:50:13.790 --> 00:50:16.630
I think we came here for the same reason

00:50:16.710 --> 00:50:17.880
Shall we exchange information?

00:50:18.710 --> 00:50:20.000
A little bit of each?

00:50:20.800 --> 00:50:22.800
Great. Then you're first

00:50:22.880 --> 00:50:24.800
If I say first,

00:50:24.880 --> 00:50:27.600
you won't tell me anything, citing the fact that you are a prince

00:50:27.680 --> 00:50:28.640
How did you understand?

00:50:30.560 --> 00:50:31.560
Okay

00:50:33.180 --> 00:50:36.810
While searching for Eunuch Kim, I came across something strange

00:50:36.900 --> 00:50:39.440
Every month he left the palace and went somewhere

00:50:40.230 --> 00:50:42.570
He came here

00:50:43.360 --> 00:50:45.530
I'm looking for shaman Choi

00:50:46.110 --> 00:50:47.030
Who else is this?

00:50:47.110 --> 00:50:49.580
I'll say this another time. For this...

00:50:50.410 --> 00:50:51.620
Wait

00:50:52.700 --> 00:50:55.830
What do you think your words mean to me?

00:50:55.920 --> 00:50:57.670
I don't know anymore

00:51:00.500 --> 00:51:03.510
- Why are you following me?
- To the shaman Bon

00:51:03.590 --> 00:51:05.220
We may not go together

00:51:05.300 --> 00:51:08.640
But I'll make him tell you everything he told you

00:51:09.300 --> 00:51:10.430
Because I'm a prince

00:51:15.730 --> 00:51:18.900
- I don't know where he is
- You know everything

00:51:18.980 --> 00:51:20.440
Yes I really don't know

00:51:23.360 --> 00:51:28.410
I talked to your uncle and your mother

00:51:28.490 --> 00:51:30.280
What did she say?

00:51:30.370 --> 00:51:32.740
Is she still really mad at me?

00:51:33.620 --> 00:51:35.660
Will he really drive me out of Sosnovy Bor?

00:51:36.960 --> 00:51:41.210
They said they would forgive you if you agreed to sign the letter

00:51:41.290 --> 00:51:44.130
So you agree to never see each other again

00:51:47.510 --> 00:51:48.340
Here it is

00:51:50.590 --> 00:51:52.050
Everything is already written there

00:51:52.140 --> 00:51:54.350
All you need to do is sign them

00:51:54.430 --> 00:51:56.230
Then you can go home

00:51:56.770 --> 00:51:58.520
You can discuss everything first

00:51:59.350 --> 00:52:03.320
I will be able to provide you with food and shelter for a while,

00:52:03.400 --> 00:52:06.400
if you decide to stay together

00:52:06.490 --> 00:52:07.320
Now I'll go

00:52:18.750 --> 00:52:19.960
Cho Young...

00:52:25.000 --> 00:52:26.170
Honestly speaking,

00:52:29.510 --> 00:52:31.260
I'm a little sorry

00:52:34.010 --> 00:52:36.100
I was afraid that I might do...

00:52:38.520 --> 00:52:40.060
too impulsive

00:52:43.860 --> 00:52:45.110
But...

00:52:51.530 --> 00:52:53.660
just the thought that I will never see you again...

00:52:56.700 --> 00:52:58.450
That's all that worries me

00:53:00.500 --> 00:53:02.210
I can't sign the letter

00:53:02.290 --> 00:53:03.960
I can't live without you

00:53:06.250 --> 00:53:08.380
Jin Cho Young vows not to see Park Dan Gu again

00:53:09.260 --> 00:53:11.430
At first it annoyed me too

00:53:14.470 --> 00:53:16.310
But I want to continue to see you

00:53:52.680 --> 00:53:54.640
Negotiations are over

00:53:54.720 --> 00:53:57.510
Moo Deok, set the table

00:54:04.060 --> 00:54:05.900
eat fish

00:54:12.320 --> 00:54:13.900
And meat too

00:54:25.960 --> 00:54:30.050
Are you really going to stay here?

00:54:30.130 --> 00:54:31.340
Yes

00:54:31.420 --> 00:54:35.510
We're going home to get our things.

00:54:35.590 --> 00:54:38.350
Are you going to make a nest here for your honeymoon?

00:54:41.430 --> 00:54:42.640
Not at all

00:54:42.730 --> 00:54:44.600
But we need a change of clothes

00:54:44.690 --> 00:54:47.400
Can you go with Jo Young and get her things?

00:54:58.200 --> 00:54:59.910
Did you throw away the paper that was lying here?

00:55:00.490 --> 00:55:01.330
It's all here

00:55:08.630 --> 00:55:09.630
Jin Cho Young vows not to see Park Dan Gu again

00:55:09.710 --> 00:55:11.250
I need to think it over

00:55:12.460 --> 00:55:15.670
If I pack my things and leave, they might really kick me out.

00:55:17.760 --> 00:55:19.090
Are you hurt?

00:55:21.350 --> 00:55:22.520
Hurt?

00:55:23.100 --> 00:55:24.600
Of course it hurts!

00:55:29.770 --> 00:55:30.810
What? Do you have a scar?

00:55:30.900 --> 00:55:32.440
Where did you get it from?

00:55:33.150 --> 00:55:34.440
I have no idea

00:55:34.530 --> 00:55:36.610
I've had it since childhood, so I don't remember

00:55:37.610 --> 00:55:39.620
This is what remains after the cut.

00:55:39.700 --> 00:55:42.790
My sister had the same one because of me

00:55:44.120 --> 00:55:47.040
She fell just like you are now

00:55:54.840 --> 00:55:57.340
A scar appeared at the site of the cut

00:56:02.260 --> 00:56:03.680
What you need

00:56:05.520 --> 00:56:08.690
I'll do my best, father.

00:56:11.110 --> 00:56:13.230
Don't call me that unnecessarily

00:56:14.440 --> 00:56:15.820
Goosebumps

00:56:25.330 --> 00:56:27.870
There was no need to be rude

00:56:28.620 --> 00:56:31.670
And why did he throw away such a beautiful silk scarf?

00:56:33.290 --> 00:56:34.380
What...

00:56:42.510 --> 00:56:45.060
It has the same pattern as Moo Deok's headband.

00:56:49.350 --> 00:56:51.810
- Has the gentleman left Jinyowon?
- Yes

00:56:54.770 --> 00:56:56.320
What kind of pattern is this?

00:56:56.400 --> 00:56:59.150
Jin family coat of arms

00:56:59.900 --> 00:57:02.030
You are going there today. Get ready

00:57:02.700 --> 00:57:03.870
Okay

00:57:06.620 --> 00:57:08.410
So that's what it was?

00:57:17.000 --> 00:57:19.630
Why did Moo Deok have a thing...

00:57:19.720 --> 00:57:22.090
with the Jinyoewon coat of arms?

00:57:29.600 --> 00:57:32.100
Pack my things without my mom finding out.

00:57:32.190 --> 00:57:33.270
Follow me

00:57:34.520 --> 00:57:37.150
I want her to go home and stay there

00:57:45.200 --> 00:57:48.120
Can you really trust him? Looks like a scam

00:57:48.950 --> 00:57:50.790
He must be special

00:57:51.370 --> 00:57:55.210
There is such fire between you. There's something more here

00:57:55.790 --> 00:57:56.960
Are you lovers?

00:57:59.250 --> 00:58:00.670
Well...

00:58:02.720 --> 00:58:05.930
My rule: do not publicize what you hear here.

00:58:06.010 --> 00:58:07.680
You can rely on me

00:58:07.760 --> 00:58:12.520
There is something significant between you, am I right?

00:58:14.020 --> 00:58:14.900
And he's good

00:58:16.270 --> 00:58:17.190
Come on...

00:58:19.360 --> 00:58:22.190
I heard that you have lived in Gema Village the longest

00:58:22.280 --> 00:58:24.700
Did you know Shaman Choi?

00:58:27.990 --> 00:58:29.240
Shaman Choi?

00:58:29.330 --> 00:58:32.250
Are you tracking the use of dark magic?

00:58:35.620 --> 00:58:39.800
Not at all. I just heard that she was very good at her craft.

00:58:39.880 --> 00:58:41.760
So I'd like to find her

00:58:45.340 --> 00:58:46.550
She was good

00:58:47.140 --> 00:58:49.050
But more than 20 years have passed since then

00:58:56.480 --> 00:58:57.810
Shaman Choi was famous for

00:58:57.900 --> 00:59:01.860
that cast witchcraft on people

00:59:02.440 --> 00:59:04.400
Once upon a time to the magicians of Jeonbugwan

00:59:04.490 --> 00:59:08.370
almost managed to catch her

00:59:09.280 --> 00:59:10.830
But she managed to jump into the fire

00:59:13.080 --> 00:59:16.620
Rumor has it that she died in that flame

00:59:17.290 --> 00:59:21.210
Others believe she was badly burned but survived

00:59:21.880 --> 00:59:23.010
Then your father Chang Gan...

00:59:23.090 --> 00:59:26.010
was Gwangju Jeonbugwan

00:59:28.800 --> 00:59:31.930
You are looking for Shaman Choi because she holds a grudge against your father.

00:59:33.060 --> 00:59:35.390
because of Jeonbugwan's persecution?

00:59:35.480 --> 00:59:37.770
I don't even remember my father

00:59:38.400 --> 00:59:40.610
How do I know who holds a grudge against him?

00:59:44.190 --> 00:59:47.240
Park Dan Goo vows not to see Jin Jo Young again

00:59:49.360 --> 00:59:51.620
You didn't sign

00:59:51.700 --> 00:59:54.240
I was thinking about signing the paper and going home

00:59:55.160 --> 00:59:57.250
but that would be a lie

00:59:57.330 --> 00:59:59.290
I can't live without her

01:00:02.500 --> 01:00:05.050
My feelings did not appear overnight

01:00:05.920 --> 01:00:09.050
I've loved her for a long time, but I haven't had the opportunity to admit it.

01:00:09.130 --> 01:00:11.100
I was able to take her hand just now

01:00:11.680 --> 01:00:13.180
Don't call our feelings childish...

01:00:13.260 --> 01:00:15.810
and give us a chance

01:00:15.890 --> 01:00:18.190
Take your belongings...

01:00:18.270 --> 01:00:19.900
and go to Uku's house

01:00:20.900 --> 01:00:22.610
- Uncle...
- I need

01:00:23.520 --> 01:00:25.070
for you to do something there

01:00:34.790 --> 01:00:36.700
If this man comes to his house,

01:00:36.790 --> 01:00:38.460
notify me immediately

01:00:38.540 --> 01:00:40.580
Who is this?

01:00:41.750 --> 01:00:43.590
Jang Gang, Jeonbugwan's gwangju

01:00:44.340 --> 01:00:45.590
Uka's father

01:00:49.220 --> 01:00:50.800
If he comes

01:00:52.760 --> 01:00:54.010
let me know

01:00:55.100 --> 01:00:56.270
Immediately

01:00:58.930 --> 01:01:00.850
That's right, I completely forgot

01:01:00.940 --> 01:01:04.440
Shaman Choi had a younger brother

01:01:05.400 --> 01:01:08.110
Do you know where he is?

01:01:08.190 --> 01:01:12.320
From that incident I never saw him again

01:01:12.990 --> 01:01:16.540
But there were rumors that he got married...

01:01:16.620 --> 01:01:18.910
on a woman from an influential family

01:01:43.600 --> 01:01:46.570
I was told it might be her

01:01:47.480 --> 01:01:49.320
Why is she wearing rags?

01:01:49.400 --> 01:01:51.860
As a child, she was washed up on the shore of Lake Gyeongjeongdaeho.

01:01:51.950 --> 01:01:54.620
She was barely breathing when the fisherman saved her

01:01:55.530 --> 01:01:58.700
After that incident she lost her memory,

01:01:59.330 --> 01:02:04.290
but despite being blind, he can sense things around him

01:02:27.310 --> 01:02:30.320
You have a mole here...

01:02:39.330 --> 01:02:41.040
And the scar is in the same place

01:02:42.370 --> 01:02:47.830
That's why they said that you are most likely our Boo Young

01:02:47.920 --> 01:02:49.420
Only now

01:02:49.500 --> 01:02:53.590
it could just be a coincidence. Need to check to make sure

01:03:00.510 --> 01:03:02.680
Let's go and see...

01:03:03.980 --> 01:03:05.770
can you open the doors of jinyeowon

01:03:15.780 --> 01:03:17.860
The people of Jeonbugwan are here again

01:03:17.950 --> 01:03:20.240
They probably brought the girl again to find out if it was Boo Young

01:03:30.290 --> 01:03:33.710
There is Jin Cho Young's blood in your body,

01:03:33.800 --> 01:03:36.340
you should be able to open Jinyoewon's doors

01:03:38.300 --> 01:03:40.890
Try to open them at least a little

01:03:41.470 --> 01:03:43.180
This will be enough

01:03:53.190 --> 01:03:55.690
Many have been here

01:03:56.400 --> 01:03:57.860
but no one opened the door

01:04:41.280 --> 01:04:42.450
Boo Young!

01:04:43.740 --> 01:04:45.040
Our Boo Young

01:04:48.500 --> 01:04:52.250
Again. Every time it happens, it's worth coming here

01:05:08.310 --> 01:05:09.850
If this happened 20 years ago,

01:05:10.390 --> 01:05:13.230
So Jin Mu was your father's student

01:05:14.360 --> 01:05:16.650
Jin Mu might know something. Should I ask him?

01:05:16.730 --> 01:05:18.440
No way

01:05:18.530 --> 01:05:21.860
Keep what you heard today a secret

01:05:23.950 --> 01:05:27.330
It doesn't look like we learned anything important, but okay.

01:05:30.790 --> 01:05:34.040
Your Highness, you came here alone, right?

01:05:34.130 --> 01:05:35.130
That's how it was

01:05:35.210 --> 01:05:38.630
But it seems that someone is following us

01:05:42.090 --> 01:05:45.260
Maybe we should split up to find out which of us is being followed?

01:06:25.390 --> 01:06:26.600
Mother!

01:07:08.720 --> 01:07:10.680
Who are you and why are you following me?

01:07:13.730 --> 01:07:14.640
I'm asking...

01:07:18.060 --> 01:07:19.150
Who are you?

01:07:51.830 --> 01:08:08.460
Thanks for watching with us!
doramamania

01:08:08.460 --> 01:08:11.320
Alchemy

01:08:08.460 --> 01:08:11.320
Shower

01:08:11.410 --> 01:08:14.950
The Boo Young that Jin Moo brought is a scammer named Song Yi

01:08:15.040 --> 01:08:16.250
Why is this here?

01:08:16.330 --> 01:08:17.750
Real daughter - Moo Deok

01:08:17.830 --> 01:08:19.790
What will happen to me if she finds out everything?

01:08:19.870 --> 01:08:22.380
Jin Moo has something that will not allow even Jin Ho Kyung to open his mouth,

01:08:22.460 --> 01:08:25.130
if she finds out about the substitution

01:08:25.710 --> 01:08:26.760
What do you want?

01:08:26.840 --> 01:08:31.340
You must destroy the Pine Forest to protect the ice stone

01:08:32.680 --> 01:08:34.600
Calm down please!

01:08:34.680 --> 01:08:37.140
Do you want to become a hero with the destiny of a royal star,

01:08:37.230 --> 01:08:39.480
destroy every ice stone and save the world from chaos?

01:08:39.560 --> 01:08:40.850
Is Seo Yul here?

01:08:40.940 --> 01:08:42.560
He'll be the first one I kill

01:08:43.270 --> 01:08:44.520
Mister!

01:08:45.980 --> 01:08:46.940
There's a nomad here!

01:08:47.030 --> 01:08:48.320
Chan Wook must die

01:08:48.400 --> 01:08:50.410
Chan Wook, my student...
